			note = "Save 50 peasants before 15 die (the {object:179694} by the path counts the dead). They walk from the cave towards {npc:14494} in waves, catch diseases and draw skeletons and skeleton archers. Cure the purple-glowing diseases first ({spell:552}), keep {spell:139} on the hurt ones, {spell:2061} the nearly dead, and kill skeletons as they spawn: one {spell:15237} of rank 3 or more kills them, oil takes two ticks while they hit you. Shield yourself at the start of each wave; friendly nameplates make the hurt peasants easy to pick out. Friends may buff you before you accept and may heal or cure peasants, but they must not heal or buff you, attack a skeleton or bring a pet once it starts, or a demon appears and kills everyone. Fail, and {npc:14494} is gone for a while (players report anything from 15 minutes to two hours); talk to her again when she is back.",
			goals = {
				{ t = "complete", quest = 7622, objs = { { count = 1, text = "The Balance of Light and Shadow" } } },
