			title = "Into Dire Maul West",
			note = "{area:2577} stands in the ruins of central {zone:1444}: from the gate at the foot of the ruins, walk up through the outer courtyards to the west wing's door at the north end. That door and an inner door need the {item:18249} (it drops from Pusillin in Dire Maul East) or a rogue with 300 Lockpicking. Bring a party of five. Lower {npc:11496}'s shield by killing the guardians of the five pylons (two stand in his own room), then kill {npc:11496}: his dais is the summoning circle. Rest and rebuff before you start.",
